  "bio": "Resurrection Tattoo ATX, nestled in the vibrant heart of Austin, stands as a beacon for aficionados of traditional and black & gray ink artistry. Their doors are always open to walk-ins, inviting a diverse clientele to be transformed by the seasoned hands of their talented artists, including @rogerfpm, @jtbtattoo, and their dynamic team. This studio is a must-visit destination for those seeking creative rebirth through timeless tattoo craftsmanship.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Austin, Texas, United States\n\n💥Austin original since 2005\n⭐️Proudly tattooing Austin for 20+ years\nWalk ins and appointments\nLocated at 3314 South Congress\nCall or txt 512 851 TATT",
